\overline{K}(b) = \frac{D_1 b}{\epsilon b - D_2} \leq \underline{K}(b) = \frac{C_1 b}{(\epsilon - C_3) b - C_2} \leq K \leq \frac{D_1 b}{\epsilon b - D_2} = \overline{K}(b),
