Then, Theorem 3.1(i) implies that 
\begin{align*}
VI(1,\theta)
= E [\nabla f(\theta_1)^\top (\theta_1 + \gamma E[\nabla f(\theta_1)])]
= E[\nabla f(\theta_1)^\top \theta_1] + \gamma \|E[\nabla f(\theta_1)]\|^2
